Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:03.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切开始于神木
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:05.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断战斗 不断祈求 不断寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:07.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从中产生了强烈的羁绊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:08.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全新的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:10.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明的未来从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与奈落的战斗结束后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:14.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原本关系应该更加和谐的两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:15.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却由于弥勒法师的缘故
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:18.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两人的关系出现了裂痕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.53,0:00:20.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样子真的好吗 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:22.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引导我们的最后一块碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.54,0:00:24.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枯井的另一边 战国的世界里还有明天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:26.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:34.27,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为谁而流的眼泪 祈祷般地流下脸颊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:41.51,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要隐藏脆弱 温柔地接受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:49.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连呼吸都忘记 眼中的天空{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:56.00,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唯有太阳闪耀着 不断寻找着什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:01:03.34,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凝视镜子 你一定能看见立誓的那天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:10.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己的背后也有翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:16.65,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的改变将改变世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:20.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实现梦想的爱的火焰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.19,0:01:27.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越虚幻的海市蜃楼{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:31.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天空有光 大地有水
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.47,0:01:40.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚强的心灵带你到未来的 ANGELUS（奉告祈祷）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:48.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双手握紧热情的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.17,0:02:06.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师还在沮丧耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为被扒手扒走了钱包吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:12.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:15.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别这么沮丧了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:17.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.15,0:02:21.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要对我说这么贴心的话好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:23.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在没有办法原谅自己这么粗心犯下的错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:29.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:34.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是沮丧的表现吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的和做的完全两回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第161话 弥勒法师的陈年旧帐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:50.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是向得道高僧求来的灵符
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.45,0:02:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用这个的话一定能够镇得住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:01.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地震
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:01.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:04.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:08.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:10.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您原谅啊 湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:15.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来好像是为了什么怪异的事情在烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果您不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们愿意助您一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:25.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥…弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.09,0:03:32.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您真的要按照约定入赘到我们家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,入赘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:38.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:40.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点准备招待法师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:43.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:45.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.44,0:03:46.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想不起来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.98,0:03:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该说同样的事要想起来会太多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.68,0:03:55.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在等您回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:04.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘 你真是越来越美了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好高兴喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:14.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:16.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是过去的事了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们夫妻本来也以为这件事已经过去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.04,0:04:21.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打算放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:23.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的女儿志麻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:25.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自幼就是体弱多病的体质
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:28.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能过着终日卧床不起的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.05,0:04:32.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候弥勒法师正好路过我们这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:34.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那已经是两年前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请将这种药草以清水煎煮后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:39.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天服用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:42.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是昂贵的药草
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疗效果然非凡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.87,0:04:47.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是非常昂贵的药草
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:51.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又坑了别人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来 两个人的感情越来越好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:58.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师给了我们药草之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:04:59.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就匆匆离去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.65,0:05:01.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:03.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是清白的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:05.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.59,0:05:06.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:08.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你康复之后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:10.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以为我生孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.76,0:05:11.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.03,0:05:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贵重的药草
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及分别时跟弥勒法师之间的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.03,0:05:18.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为我心灵的支柱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.97,0:05:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来我果然彻底康复了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:24.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然又是在追求人家嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.17,0:05:28.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好啊 反正都是过去的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:30.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 无聊死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:32.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事情怎样都无所谓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.98,0:05:34.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会无所谓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.55,0:05:36.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒是刚才说的怪异的事 是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:38.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:40.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才在祠堂那边发生的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:44.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有地震耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.93,0:05:46.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好怕喔 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:52.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我害怕的是另外一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:56.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 请您一定要救救我们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:06:00.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这么下去 女儿就要成为妖怪的新娘了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:01.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为妖怪的新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:03.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是…是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:06.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那座祠堂 是用来祭祀湖神大人的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:10.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个湖神大人说无论如何一定要志麻嫁给他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:15.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也跟他说我已经有了未婚夫 但他就是不相信
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:20.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问 未婚夫是指…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:21.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是指你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:29.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是弥勒法师并没有忘记跟我的约定而回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:32.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是多么期盼着这一天的到来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.11,0:06:38.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.05,0:06:41.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能把志麻姑娘交给那个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您愿意帮助我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:46.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么马上举办婚礼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.69,0:06:52.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是要我们把妖怪除掉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:56.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来对方不论怎样都想生下弥勒的孩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:07.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.77,0:07:11.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天晚上就是约定的日子咯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.09,0:07:21.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好冷喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么只有弥勒留在房子里面呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他好像说有事要商量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拒绝当入赘的女婿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:34.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是当然的咯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:37.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为弥勒法师已经跟珊瑚订下婚约了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:41.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以相信那个家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:42.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是弥勒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:45.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送到嘴边不吃是男人的耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.68,0:07:46.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:54.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么时候学会说这种坏话的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:57.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且要说也要顺便看看场合啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:07:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:05.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很希望您能够尽早和我女儿完婚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:09.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是想抢走志麻姑娘的湖神大人是妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.50,0:08:12.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管志麻姑娘是否嫁给他人为妻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:13.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也都会来抢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:15.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算举办婚礼也没用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 正是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:19.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:21.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要一个清纯的少女来当他的新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.35,0:08:26.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果举行了婚礼的话 他就不得不放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这么重礼教啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:30.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样 在湖神大人来这里之前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.66,0:08:32.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请让我成为弥勒法师的妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:34.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送到嘴边的肉不吃 可是男人的耻辱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:39.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:46.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥…勒…法…师… 怪…怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.31,0:08:54.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是试着把珊瑚的心情表现出来而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:55.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有生气呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:09:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 打扰你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:02.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的眼睛好像是在说“去死吧 混蛋”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.56,0:09:12.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.47,0:09:13.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位女客人是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:16.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 不瞒您说…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有地震
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:21.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还是个带着腥味的家伙接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:25.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照这么看起来\N好像是那个叫什么湖神大人的驾临了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:38.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.73,0:09:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依照约定 我来迎娶志麻姑娘为我的妻子了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:43.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然他这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:45.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个家伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.47,0:09:47.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经自报姓名了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要来阻碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.51,0:10:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家那位姑娘不愿意啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖…湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 好可怕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:06.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的有那么可怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.89,0:10:08.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:09.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.29,0:10:13.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧 死心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:15.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为…为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是已经清清楚楚约定好要嫁给我了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:19.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约定好？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:21.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有跟你约定好什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:27.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您原谅我 湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:28.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:30.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:33.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为要煎煮那么贵重的药
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.91,0:10:36.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请将这种药草以清水煎煮后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.52,0:10:37.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天服用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:41.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是用湖中的水来煎煮药的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:42.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且因为顺路
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:46.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每天都到湖的祠堂许下愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:51.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人啊 请治好我女儿的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.16,0:10:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管您要我们怎么报答您都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:57.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我作梦也没想到这些话真的被湖神大人听见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:01.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此湖神大人说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:04.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让志麻姑娘嫁给他以作为报答吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.21,0:11:07.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说这件事会是我的错吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么觉得他有点可怜耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:12.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲竟然许下了那样的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.69,0:11:17.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:18.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.49,0:11:21.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为您一心一意盼着我的病能够治得好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:23.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:25.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是没办法的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.57,0:11:26.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然说我事先不知情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.07,0:11:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是约定就是约定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:31.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:34.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会真的想嫁给这个妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:37.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:42.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本就没有成为湖神大人新娘的资格
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:49.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人您希望娶一个清纯的少女作为新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:11:57.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我已经在两年前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:12:01.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟这位弥勒法师结合为夫妇了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:05.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真…真的是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:08.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 父亲大人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:10.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事我实在无法说出口
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:12.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早料到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:15.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是就算改口这样说 还是觉得很震惊耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:20.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好啊 已经是过去的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:24.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您当作没有发生过这件事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:30.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们欺骗了我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.64,0:12:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所谓爱越深恨越深
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:44.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大鲶鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:48.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你们这些家伙体会一下我的悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的房子就快要被毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.55,0:12:54.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 救救我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:56.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了 让我们来镇住它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.29,0:12:58.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们上 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一个人去收拾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:05.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是你以前犯的错吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:08.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请…请问…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位女客人也要开始变身了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:15.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…她不是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.84,0:13:17.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是争论的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:19.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的房子…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:25.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的对手是我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.99,0:13:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要一口把你吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:30.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 听我说你就明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:32.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.13,0:13:37.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们果然是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那两个人会变得怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.37,0:13:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:50.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在应该是要看犬夜叉跟大鲶鱼那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:14:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟敢把我当傻瓜一样耍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.98,0:14:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少自大了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:08.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.45,0:14:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还想打的话 我也要动真格的了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.66,0:14:18.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:21.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来是这么的相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.10,0:14:23.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他镇静下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.03,0:14:25.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:29.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在是不是已经对我死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.61,0:14:34.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.98,0:14:37.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 就算杀了这个家伙也会睡得不安稳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 那边的事态好像越来越严重了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.39,0:14:44.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 还在吵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:47.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你连我的话都不想听了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:53.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:54.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不想管了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:14:58.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个弥勒花心又好色的毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.67,0:15:01.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不是从今天昨天才开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.17,0:15:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:06.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你真的一点都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果过去曾经跟对方交往过的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:09.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现在自己的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:11.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心情怎么可能会好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.28,0:15:15.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那个 请你们不要吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:16.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.39,0:15:18.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.79,0:15:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你不要责怪弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:25.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:26.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你不追吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:37.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不管我说什么她都听不进去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.11,0:15:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是感觉真的有一些落寞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:44.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到她竟然对我如此不信任
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明我的心一直都属于她一个人的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.35,0:15:53.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来好像是在说他是冤枉的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的是冤枉的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:15:59.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻 救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:03.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.47,0:16:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您放过我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:06.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:09.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起在湖底生活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.27,0:16:12.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 果然应该给它最后致命的一击
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧去追人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.23,0:16:33.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师没有追来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:38.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后我该怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:42.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs28}不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:44.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管发生什么事 你都要成为我的新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.74,0:16:50.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说过我已经跟弥勒法师结合了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:55.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会原谅你的 我可以原谅你过去的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.77,0:17:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是弥勒法师的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:16.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.94,0:17:18.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:22.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他根本就不是来追我的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:29.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:31.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这个人带到安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:33.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:35.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:37.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨被弹开了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.98,0:17:55.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.48,0:17:57.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我就顺便把你带到湖底
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:18:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我的小妾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.32,0:18:03.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.53,0:18:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢抓我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:13.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:21.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里可是湖水之中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:24.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可能会被你这个家伙抓住呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.51,0:18:31.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.95,0:18:33.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然如此 这招怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.58,0:18:34.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.97,0:18:55.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水好像…开始消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:20.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个臭鲶鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我警告你不准动我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.87,0:19:27.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这个女人也是你的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:30.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:33.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.49,0:19:48.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:53.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在叫你呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:19:59.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.84,0:20:01.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs28}珊瑚 等等我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.07,0:20:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然没有…我上场的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.41,0:20:12.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.35,0:20:17.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到头来 这只是一段无法实现的恋情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:25.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我说谎欺骗了大家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:27.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟弥勒法师已经结合的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.03,0:20:29.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是假的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:30.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.13,0:20:32.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不想当鲶鱼的新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:33.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不知不觉就…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.20,0:20:37.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这是志麻姑娘急中生智吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:39.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如…如果是那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.41,0:20:42.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要把这个真相告诉我一个人不就好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:44.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:47.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我对你非常的信任
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为不说出来你也会明白
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.22,0:20:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这都要怪我平日行为不端吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.43,0:21:00.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你留下了不好的回忆 真是对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:01.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:05.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:06.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.17,0:21:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救我的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.21,0:21:12.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是觉得有点高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.61,0:21:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你原谅我了吗 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:18.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这句话应该是我要说的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚的心胸真的好宽大喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:27.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者应该说比戈薇宽大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:34.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们很相配呢 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:43.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:46.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是早点否认的话 就不会发生那种事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.41,0:21:49.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.61,0:21:51.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是为了要回想起过去的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花了很长的时间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说中了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:21:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.29,0:21:59.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说 是那样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.16,0:22:03.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正都是过去的事了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.39,0:22:14.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New World 全新梦想的起点{\fad(0,200)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:21.24,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝向目标持续旅程 直到最后{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:29.48,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New Mind 怀抱热情直到下一扇门扉{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:35.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲向未知的世界 快奔驰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.13,0:22:44.76,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伸手触摸 那微尘般的希望之星{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:53.50,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使勉强握住 横冲直撞的我们想往何处?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:59.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保有自我 Let's go and Try 前进吧 使命只有One way{\fad(0,25)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.71,0:23:06.78,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺其自然 Do it! Ready? 最后愿望将达成{\fad(50,200)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.89,0:23:13.76,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New World 全新梦想的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.86,0:23:20.79,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝向目标持续旅程 直到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.97,0:23:29.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New Mind 怀抱热情直到下一扇门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.18,0:23:35.48,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲向未知的世界 快奔驰吧{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.09,0:23:52.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 邪见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.73,0:23:54.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲被妖怪抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.76,0:23:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专门驱魔除妖的法师好像已经去救她了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.40,0:24:00.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那位法师平生最恨妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.33,0:24:02.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是他和杀生丸碰上 事情就不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.57,0:24:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类那种不成气候的法术 能有什么用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.84,0:24:06.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对会被杀生丸撕成碎片的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.94,0:24:08.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.68,0:24:10.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.14,0:24:13.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远与杀生丸少爷在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.71,0:24:14.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.11,0:24:16.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算小玲死了 请您也不要忘记我
